PARITY (web Modal.tsx → native)
  • open / onClose / title / size(sm|md|lg|full) / children / ariaLabel  → all reproduced.
  • `< 640px` full-width bottom sheet ↔ `≥ sm` centered card w/ max-width  → ModalLayout.mode +
    ModalMetrics.maxWidth (sm 384 / md 512 / lg 672 / full min(96vw,1100)).
  • backdrop tap close · Esc close · 44×44 close button (WCAG 2.5.5)        → reproduced.
  • role=dialog + aria-modal + aria-labelledby/aria-label                   → .accessibilityAddTraits(.isModal)
    + ModalAccessibility.dialogLabel (title ?? ariaLabel ?? fallback) + .isHeader title.
  • focus into dialog on open / Tab-trap / focus returns to trigger        → @AccessibilityFocusState
    on open + .isModal focus trap + model re-arms open telemetry on close.
  • the two React "data sources": useId → dialog accessible-name identity;
    useImperativeHandle → focus-on-open + .isModal (native focus-trap peer). Documented in source.
  • --surface-1 / --glass-border tokens                                     → Color.TS.surface/.border.
STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface): loading (skeleton) · empty (friendly msg) · error
  (retry) · data (titled sections) · + orthogonal connection axis live / stale (chip+banner+one-shot
  auto-refresh) / offline (chip+banner, cached body). All exercised in previews + verified below.

